  "title": "Vegan Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "This vegan pumpkin bread recipe made with warming spices, molasses, applesauce and flax &#34;eggs&#34; makes 2 loaves, so plan to share one with family or friends.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Osborn Vitorovich"
  ],
